{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは〜🌙"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "四期生の目黒陽色(めぐろひいろ)です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日は「みんなに会える日」のコーデを振り返って紹介します♪"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "1，リアルミーグリ幕張コーデ🫧"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobZUh194.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobfFfR9X.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobjffVUH.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "盛れ度 ★★★★★"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "透明感 ★★★☆☆"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "沼らせ力 ★★★★☆"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "動きやすさ　★★☆☆☆"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "寝坊対応力　★★★★☆"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みたいなかんじ❔☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "花柄のワンピースは着やすくて好き🫶"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさん褒めてもらえてうれしかったな〜♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2，リアルミーグリ京都コーデ🧸"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobyqROl9.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob11ebsw.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "親しみやすさ　★★★★☆"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お姉さん度 ★★★★☆"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "清楚感 ★★★☆☆"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "春らしさ ★★★★★"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ときめき度　★★★★☆"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "初めましての方にも話しかけやすそうな、やわらかい印象のコーデでした🌷"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "♡ミーグリ後の幸福度　MAX★★★★★"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "会いに来てくれたみんな、本当に幸せな時間をありがとう☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "久しぶりにみんなと1番近くでお話しできて嬉しかったな〜。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんながね"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "例えば、櫻坂46に加入してくれてありがとうって改めて言ってくれたり、一緒に夢を叶えようねって言ってくれたり。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そんな温かくって、夢があって、気持ちのこもった言葉を受け取るたびにいつも心の奥があつくなる。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こういう経験は、グループに加入して初めて知ったものだから、これからもこの感情を大切にしたいな。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かわいい祝花をくださった皆さん。本当にありがとう！！🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お花大好きだから、カメラロールにアルバム作って、沢山眺められるようにしてあるの。たまに見返すんだ〜😚"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "昨日のみーぐり🐈‍⬛"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobKgTVTU.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobja2Cm0.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "💋💄"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobbeYUzF.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "スタイル盛れ度　★★★★★"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "小悪魔度 ★★★★☆"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大人っぽさ   ★★★★☆"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ラフさ ★★★★★"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ポップさ　★★★☆☆"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近お気に入りのボルドーカラーのヒールがポイントなんだ〜👠👩♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日のミーグリ👩‍🍳🌳"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobWFmSqy.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobnCm88B.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かわいさ ★★★★★"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おしとやか ★★★★★"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "文学少女感　★★★★☆"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "癒し度 ★★★★★"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "レア度 ★★★★☆"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "実は、森の小さなレストラン開いてます🍽️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今シングルのオンラインミーグリは今日でラスト！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "来てくださった皆さん本当にありがとうございました🙇‍♀️🤍"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつもあっという間に感じるのは1秒1秒が濃くて大切な瞬間だからなんだろうな、、。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなのこと好き度はいつでもどこでも★MAXだよ。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おやすみ☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね👋"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🎧Conan Gray - Heather"}], "source": "official"}